{# A character who speaks another language (Entity.yaml spoken_language, per NPC): the model writes their
   lines in it and, right after each sentence, the sentence in the language the conversation is otherwise
   written in, inside a <translation> block, for the subtitles only. SkyrimNet pairs a sentence with its block:
   the voice says the sentence, the subtitle shows both, the record and other NPCs keep the sentence alone.
   A sentence without a block has no translation line. decnpc(uuid).spokenLanguage is {code, name}, or
   nothing. The conversation's own language is never named: players who prompt for another one keep it. #}
{% if (render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts") and decnpc(npc.UUID).spokenLanguage %}
{% set _sl = decnpc(npc.UUID).spokenLanguage %}
{% set _name = decnpc(npc.UUID).name %}
{% set _ex1 = "" %}
{% set _ex2 = "" %}
{% if _sl.code == "ja" %}{% set _ex1 = "今はだめ。" %}{% set _ex2 = "一時間後にまた来て。" %}
{% else if _sl.code == "ko" %}{% set _ex1 = "지금은 안 돼." %}{% set _ex2 = "한 시간 뒤에 다시 와." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "zh" %}{% set _ex1 = "现在不行。" %}{% set _ex2 = "一个小时后再来。" %}
{% else if _sl.code == "ru" %}{% set _ex1 = "Не сейчас." %}{% set _ex2 = "Возвращайся через час." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "it" %}{% set _ex1 = "Non ora." %}{% set _ex2 = "Torna tra un'ora." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "es" %}{% set _ex1 = "Ahora no." %}{% set _ex2 = "Vuelve dentro de una hora." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "pt" %}{% set _ex1 = "Agora não." %}{% set _ex2 = "Volte daqui a uma hora." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "de" %}{% set _ex1 = "Jetzt nicht." %}{% set _ex2 = "Komm in einer Stunde wieder." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "fr" %}{% set _ex1 = "Pas maintenant." %}{% set _ex2 = "Reviens dans une heure." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "ar" %}{% set _ex1 = "ليس الآن." %}{% set _ex2 = "ارجع بعد ساعة." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "pl" %}{% set _ex1 = "Nie teraz." %}{% set _ex2 = "Wróć za godzinę." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "nl" %}{% set _ex1 = "Nu niet." %}{% set _ex2 = "Kom over een uur terug." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "hi" %}{% set _ex1 = "अभी नहीं।" %}{% set _ex2 = "एक घंटे बाद वापस आना।" %}
{% else if _sl.code == "he" %}{% set _ex1 = "לא עכשיו." %}{% set _ex2 = "תחזור בעוד שעה." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "cs" %}{% set _ex1 = "Teď ne." %}{% set _ex2 = "Vrať se za hodinu." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "hu" %}{% set _ex1 = "Most nem." %}{% set _ex2 = "Gyere vissza egy óra múlva." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "tr" %}{% set _ex1 = "Şimdi değil." %}{% set _ex2 = "Bir saat sonra tekrar gel." %}
{% else if _sl.code == "en" %}{% set _ex1 = "Not now." %}{% set _ex2 = "Come back in an hour." %}
{% endif %}
## Spoken Language
{% if render_mode == "thoughts" %}
{{ _name }} speaks and thinks in {{ _sl.name }}. Write the thought in {{ _sl.name }}, in {{ _name }}'s voice. After it, inside <translation>...</translation>, give the same thought in the language this conversation is otherwise written in: a faithful translation, the same meaning and length, shown to the player only. One block, at the end, nothing after it.
{% if length(_ex1) > 0 %}
- Example, for a conversation written in English: {{ _ex1 }} {{ _ex2 }} <translation>Not now. Come back in an hour.</translation>
{% endif %}
{% else %}
{{ _name }} speaks {{ _sl.name }}. Write every spoken sentence in {{ _sl.name }}, in {{ _name }}'s personality and register, using the established {{ _sl.name }} localization of Elder Scrolls names and terms. Right after each sentence, inside <translation>...</translation>, give that sentence in the language this conversation is otherwise written in: a faithful translation, the same meaning and length, for the subtitles only.
- One <translation> block directly after each spoken sentence, the last one included: a sentence without its block is a mistake. Never put the translation first, never group several sentences into one block.
{% if is_audio_tags_enabled(npc.UUID) %}
- Keep [performance tags] in the sentence itself; do not repeat them inside the block.
{% endif %}
- Narration in *asterisks* and ACTION lines stay in the language this conversation is otherwise written in, with no block.
{% if exists("allow_inline_internal_thoughts") and allow_inline_internal_thoughts %}
- Inside an <internal_thought> block, think in {{ _sl.name }} too and end the thought with one <translation> block holding the whole thought in the conversation's language.
{% else %}
- Everything else you write is spoken aloud: no <internal_thought> blocks.
{% endif %}
{% if length(_ex1) > 0 %}
- Example, for a conversation written in English: {{ _ex1 }} <translation>Not now.</translation>{% if is_narration_enabled() %} *{{ _name }} does not look up*{% endif %} {{ _ex2 }} <translation>Come back in an hour.</translation>
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
